Getting up to speed, in this order: `docs/M0-findings.md` (what was verified and what is still open), `git log --oneline v0.2.0..HEAD`, `docs/knowledge/core/PHILOSOPHY.md` whole, `docs/knowledge/core/MANUAL.md`, `docs/knowledge/core/DECISIONS.md`, then `docs/knowledge/INDEX.md` for how to read the rest. `docs/FACTORY-SPEC-v2.md` is the original design and is read in ranges, never whole. `/knowledge <question>` for anything else.

